A smart home

The `Living room` holds the `Lamp` and the `Speaker`. The `Hallway` holds the
`Motion sensor`. The `Motion sensor` reports to the `Home hub`, and the
`Home hub` turns on the `Lamp`.
---
Living room { Lamp, Speaker }
Hallway { Motion sensor }
Motion sensor -> Home hub: motion
Home hub -> Lamp: turn on
Home hub -> Speaker: announce
